[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10742.389, "timestamp": "02:59:02", "text": "那就像一个滑稽的小东西，就像很多东西一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10745.59, "timestamp": "02:59:05", "text": "此外，一些 YouTuber 也参与了那部动画的制作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10748.71, "timestamp": "02:59:08", "text": "那真不错。那真是太好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10752.63, "timestamp": "02:59:12", "text": "就像孩子们眼中的光芒，然后是赤井舞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10757.83, "timestamp": "02:59:17", "text": "玛丽亚·阿凯，然后是卡卡·露娜，还有那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10761.349, "timestamp": "02:59:21", "text": "现在都是些大人物了。是的，所有那些大的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10763.269, "timestamp": "02:59:23", "text": "人们。它们也挺旧的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10771.269, "timestamp": "02:59:31", "text": "我的意思是，就像很多人都在离开一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10773.83, "timestamp": "02:59:33", "text": "现在。这让我有点难过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10776.71, "timestamp": "02:59:36", "text": "啊，是的。所以，这些YouTube博主是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10779.429, "timestamp": "02:59:39", "text": "离开。最近有很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10782.71, "timestamp": "02:59:42", "text": "毕业什么的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10784.55, "timestamp": "02:59:44", "text": "人们都在猜测，哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10786.55, "timestamp": "02:59:46", "text": "它们会变成空心的，或者可能是下一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10791.83, "timestamp": "02:59:51", "text": "山治。真是太令人难过了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10795.59, "timestamp": "02:59:55", "text": "阿米莉亚当时大概在某个地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10798.07, "timestamp": "02:59:58", "text": "还"}]